codex
The train fetches sign-off refs with pruning, and its pure-merge check compares both parents and trees. I found a gap in the hook’s record check: its positive control uses four files containing only `x`, so it demonstrates acceptance of a non-record. I’ll check that behavior and the verifier’s tree checks in a temporary repository.
